    <string name="service_label">Rokoreels</string>
    <!-- Shown by Android in Accessibility settings; keep in step with onboarding 4/6 (onb_access_*). -->
    <string name="service_description">Counts the short videos you swipe through in Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, Snapchat Spotlight, TikTok, Moj and Josh, times how long you spend in these apps and in Facebook, X and Reddit, shows Iris over them, and takes you out of them when you reach your daily limits or your focus hours. It looks only at which screen is open and labels like \"Sponsored\", reads no messages or passwords, and never sends what\'s on your screen anywhere.</string>

